# Justice, Vance Astrovik: "When Justice enters, return up to one target nonland, nontoken permanent to its owner's hand" and
# "Whenever another nonland permanent you control is returned to its owner's hand, put a +1/+1 counter on Justice." {2}{U} is
# paid exactly by Black Lotus. Justice returns Bot1's own Mox Pearl, which Justice sees (it is on the battlefield as the
# ability resolves): one counter, a 3/3. Bot1's Island is a land and no legal target (the refusal, beside the Mox).

